{"_id":"686c963472e8e01d00ab1c59","title":"ClientSide Free Pro (FIXED)","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/dddb3d0dfbe1e6cc63916d1ec4471b819e65fc58385b90e441faa5187afe0d21.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1751946804815.png"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/dddb3d0dfbe1e6cc63916d1ec4471b819e65fc58385b90e441faa5187afe0d21.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1751946804815.png"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-ClientSide-Free-Pro-44317","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":11628,"executes":411,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/66e0c90d2af99a6ff62a163dc1ab47f601a13e01af7565ba0a4e7f9e933a097f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1751946804815.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1751946804815.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/66e0c90d2af99a6ff62a163dc1ab47f601a13e01af7565ba0a4e7f9e933a097f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1751946804815.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1751946804815.png"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-07-08T03:53:24.853Z","updatedAt":"2025-07-08T03:53:24.853Z","lastBump":"2025-07-08T03:53:24.853Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/TheBlueDemon-Demon/593ceaff3aa695235dc527625631d295/raw/026df0e3e283ee3b843b7036b3b2897eef25bcc0/ClientSidedScript%2520(Free%2520Pro)\"))()\n","features":"Draggable GUI Window (not working atm)\n\nThe main control panel can be dragged anywhere on your screen for convenience.\n\nStarts hidden; toggle its visibility with the “Toggle Utility GUI” button at top-left.\n\nFly Toggle\n\nEnables smooth flying movement using your WASD keys and camera direction.\n\nUses a BodyVelocity on your character’s HumanoidRootPart to simulate flight.\n\nFully client-sided: only you see yourself flying, and physics resume when toggled off.\n\nNoclip Toggle\n\nWhen enabled, disables collision on all your character’s parts, allowing you to walk through walls and objects.\n\nWhen disabled, restores normal collisions.\n\nClient-sided only; other players don’t see your noclip.\n\nRandom Skybox Toggle\n\nApplies a random skybox (background environment) from a preset list of Roblox skybox asset IDs.\n\nThe sky changes immediately when toggled on.\n\nTurning it off removes the custom skybox, returning to the default lighting.\n\nOnly affects your client’s view.\n\nESP (Extra Sensory Perception) Toggle\n\nShows a red translucent box around every other player’s HumanoidRootPart.\n\nDisplays their name and distance from you beneath the box.\n\nBoxes are created with BillboardGuis, so they don’t collide with anything and are visible only to you.\n\nUpdates in real time as players move, join, or leave.\n\nRainbow Character Toggle\n\nChanges your character’s body part colors continuously cycling through the rainbow colors smoothly.\n\nApplies to all BaseParts except HumanoidRootPart.\n\nWhen toggled off, restores your character’s color to plain white.\n\nGUI Visibility Toggle Button\n\nA persistent button in the top-left corner of your screen that shows or hides the main utility GUI window. (nope)\n\nNewly added ANTI-CHEAT!\n\nAnd more!","tags":["Fly","Noclip","ClientSided"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"685893beab59a6f90233209c","username":"mskitowskis","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d60fe14668740ab1d2b9de508a589db05ee544d54670e333d5822d2165259148.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/685893beab59a6f90233209c-1752052656220.png"},"status":"offline","id":"685893beab59a6f90233209c","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d60fe14668740ab1d2b9de508a589db05